description:
This beautiful condo is located on the Cumberland River in downtown Nashville. It features 1 bedroom (king size bed) with en-suite; fully stocked kitchen; cozy living room (queen size sleeper sofa) & dining area with amazing views; and a private balcony overlooking the Cumberland River!
Only a short distance to many venues such as lower Broadway, Nashvile Sounds stadium, Titans stadium, Germantown, Farmers Market, Bicentennial Mall, and many more fun attractions.

The space
1 bedroom with king bed and en-suite;
Living room with sleeper sofa;
Fully stocked kitchen;
Bar height dining table;
Private balcony
Located on top floor (third floor)

Other things to note
Please note:
We are located on the 3rd floor (which means no one is above); however, there is no elevator.
This is an up and coming neighborhood with construction near by.
